<title>USA: Genesis Development 1996 EPS $0.20.</title>
<headline>Genesis Development 1996 EPS $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel-based Genesis Development and Construction Ltd said it reported revenues of $6.7 million and net income of $68,355, or $0.20 a share, in its first complete year of operations in 1996.</p>
<p>The company's net income included a charge of $234,919 relating to its November 1996 bridge financing agreement, it said.</p>
<p>The company conducted an initial public offering in February 1997.</p>
</text>
